          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_The newborn troll began to crawl. He moved very slowly. It was as if he was still dreaming, or as if his inner flame had only just begun to warm.</i>"),
